@vastg5453 First. You stated a rock can kill all passengers in one go. I only quantified what you said. 
My car has severe hail storm damage yet my sunroof was unaffected. Sure, my sunroof doesn't  have the same span as a full panoramic roof but my wife's car with a panoramic roof was fine after the same storm.
Sure, I agree that there are risks with things falling from the sky and building windows but with how frequently such incidents occur to the extent that you describe, there are other scenerios more worthy of your paranoia. Maybe we're better off staying indoors

