Doing exactly what China was and is doing, just as every country does! Having foreign policy interests, not foreign policy friends. Countries don't have friends, they have interests.

I am very curious too, about what China's interests are? Their conduct in the South China Sea for example, doesn't look like glorious good will towards other neighbouring countries. It look like territorial theft. So please don't try to paint China as well intentioned all the time. They are no different to any other country that has interests that it seeks to pursue ruthlessly. All countries do good and not so good things, if it is in their interest to do so. China is no exception.

